This package contains MIT-licensed portions derived from Oh My Pi (OMP):

  - src/providers/cursor-not-cloud/agent.proto
  - src/providers/cursor-not-cloud/agent_pb.ts (generated from agent.proto)
  - src/providers/cursor-not-cloud/index.ts (OMP-derived portions)
  - src/providers/cursor-not-cloud/compat.ts (OMP-derived portions)
  - src/providers/cursor-not-cloud/cursor-pi-args.ts (OMP-derived portions)
  - src/providers/cursor-not-cloud/exec-modern.ts (OMP-derived portions)
  - src/utils/cursor-not-cloud-blocks.ts (OMP-derived portions)

The protobuf baseline is the exact agent.proto from Oh My Pi tag v17.2.15,
commit 06aecdd51f07e689e970ceaa180abe2be0c14bbb. OMP is MIT licensed;
Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Can Bölük.

Prime Agent independently specifies one small factual wire extension to that
MIT baseline: TurnEndedUpdate fields 1-5, the optional int64 input, output,
cache-read, cache-write, and reasoning token counters. No schema declaration
copied or refreshed from an installed Cursor binary is distributed here. This
notice makes no claim about Cursor software licensing.

These files ship in compiled form under dist/. The complete MIT license text,
including the OMP copyright notice, is provided in the LICENSE file distributed
with this package.
